{"uid":"c698bc079741dab2","name":"test_attach_skill_to_agent_with_version_selector","fullName":"tests.ui.skills.test_skill_agent_version_selector.TestAttachSkillToAgentWithVersionSelector#test_attach_skill_to_agent_with_version_selector","historyId":"1c0da7c17ef7df6da94d4f3309c6e517","time":{"start":1786959149900,"stop":1786959184065,"duration":34165},"description":"Create a skill + agent, attach the skill, and verify the version\n        selector shows the default version, opens a real Versions menu, and\n        persists across a full page reload.\n\n        Steps (AFS test-specs/skills/l3_attach-skill-to-agent-with-version-selector_ELITEA-1789.md):\n        1. Create a Skill with a saved `base` version.\n        2. Create an Agent.\n        3. Locate the Skills attachment section (expanded by default).\n        4-5. Attach the Skill; verify the counter updates and the card renders.\n        6. Verify the attached Skill card shows a version selector, and that\n           clicking it (via a correctly-scoped `.version-text` locator, NOT a\n           role-based one) opens a real \"Versions\" menu — hard-asserted\n           functional flow per the AFS (known defect #46 is a handle-quality/\n           accessibility gap, not a flaky functional failure).\n        7. Confirm the default version (`base`) is shown pre-selected, both\n           on the card and as the sole entry in the opened Versions menu.\n        8. Confirm persistence via a full page reload (no explicit\n           agent-level Save is available — attach is auto-saved via API).\n        ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Create a skill + agent, attach the skill, and verify the version<br />\nselector shows the default version, opens a real Versions menu, and<br />\npersists across a full page reload.</p>\n<pre><code>    Steps (AFS test-specs/skills/l3_attach-skill-to-agent-with-version-selector_ELITEA-1789.md):\n    1. Create a Skill with a saved `base` version.\n    2. Create an Agent.\n    3. Locate the Skills attachment section (expanded by default).\n    4-5. Attach the Skill; verify the counter updates and the card renders.\n    6. Verify the attached Skill card shows a version selector, and that\n       clicking it (via a correctly-scoped `.version-text` locator, NOT a\n       role-based one) opens a real &quot;Versions&quot; menu — hard-asserted\n       functional flow per the AFS (known defect #46 is a handle-quality/\n       accessibility gap, not a flaky functional failure).\n    7. Confirm the default version (`base`) is shown pre-selected, both\n       on the card and as the sole entry in the opened Versions menu.\n    8. Confirm persistence via a full page reload (no explicit\n       agent-level Save is available — attach is auto-saved via API).\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1786958753059,"stop":1786958753059,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1786958753059,"stop":1786958753060,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1786958753060,"stop":1786958753060,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1786958753060,"stop":1786958753060,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":17869587